mapping_tip:
Enter valid JSON to map model names before requests are sent to the endpoint. For example:
{
  "gpt-4o": "gpt-4o-test"
}
When FastGPT requests gpt-4o, the endpoint receives gpt-4o-test instead.

model.rerank_default_config_tip:
This configuration is merged into each rerank request. For example:
"""
{
   "topn": 5
}
"""

model.voices_tip:
Configure multiple voices as an array, for example:
[
  {
    "label": "Alloy",
    "value": "alloy"
  },
  {
    "label": "Echo",
    "value": "echo"
  }
]
